#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:926
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_PlayerHasEnteredDome"
msgid "{PLAYER} has entered the BATTLE DOME!$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}进入了对战巨蛋！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:929
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_PlayerVersusTrainer"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"match!\p"
"{PLAYER} versus {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"Let the battle begin!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"比赛！\p"
"{PLAYER}对战{STR_VAR_2}！\p"
"对战开始！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:935
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_PlayerIsWinner"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} is the winner!\n"
"Congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}获胜！\n"
"恭喜！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:939
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_TrainerIsWinner"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2} is the winner!\n"
"Congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_2}获胜！\n"
"恭喜！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:943
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_PlayerIsLv50Champ"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} is the Level 50\n"
"Battle Tournament Champion!\p"
"Congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}成为了\n"
"Lv.50对战锦标赛的冠军！\p"
"恭喜！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:948
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_PlayerIsLvOpenChamp"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} is the Open Level\n"
"Battle Tournament Champion!\p"
"Congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}成为了\n"
"自由等级对战锦标赛的冠军！\p"
"恭喜！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:953
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_RefereeDecisionPleaseWait"
msgid ""
"What an unbelievable finish!\n"
"We have a double knockout!\p"
"In this event, the Battle Tournament\n"
"rules call for a REFEREE'S decision.\p"
"Please wait while the judging\n"
"is under way.$"
msgstr ""
"多么难以置信的结局！\n"
"双方同时倒下了！\p"
"这种情况下，按照对战锦标赛的\n"
"规则，要由裁判来判定。\p"
"裁判正在评审，\n"
"请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:961
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_RefereesDecidedWinnerTrainer"
msgid ""
"The REFEREES have reached\n"
"a decision!\p"
"The winner is…\n"
"Oh, my goodness!\l"
"The winner is {STR_VAR_1}!\l"
"Congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
"裁判已经作出判定了！\p"
"获胜的是……\n"
"哦，天哪！\l"
"获胜的是{STR_VAR_1}！\l"
"恭喜！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:969
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_RefereesDecidedWinnerPlayer"
msgid ""
"The REFEREES have reached\n"
"a decision!\p"
"The winner is…\n"
"Oh, my goodness!\l"
"The winner is {PLAYER}!\l"
"Congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
"裁判已经作出判定了！\p"
"获胜的是……\n"
"哦，天哪！\l"
"获胜的是{PLAYER}！\l"
"恭喜！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:977
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_BrightNewHope"
msgid ""
"The bright new hope!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"闪亮的新希望！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:981
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_RisingStar"
msgid ""
"The rising star!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"冉冉升起的新星！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:985
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_WillTheyRaceToChampionship"
msgid ""
"Will this TRAINER race to\n"
"the championship?\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"这位训练家\n"
"能一路冲向冠军吗？\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:990
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_CanAchieveChampionFirstTry"
msgid ""
"Can the feat of a championship\n"
"on the first try be achieved?\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"能否创下首次参赛\n"
"就夺冠的壮举呢？\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:995
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_CanLossBeAvenged"
msgid ""
"Can the loss of the last match\n"
"be avenged?\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"能否一雪\n"
"上一场比赛的耻辱呢？\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1000
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_OnFireForChampionship"
msgid ""
"The TRAINER is on fire for\n"
"the first championship try!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"这位训练家正燃烧着斗志，\n"
"向首个冠军发起挑战！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1005
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_WinHereAdvancesToFinal"
msgid ""
"A win here means this TRAINER\n"
"advances to the final!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"赢下这一场，\n"
"这位训练家就能进入决赛！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1010
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_WillLongHeldDreamComeTrue"
msgid ""
"Will the long-held dream of\n"
"a championship finally come true?\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"长久以来的冠军梦想\n"
"终于能实现了吗？\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1015
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_TheInvincibleChampion"
msgid ""
"The invincible champion!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"无敌的冠军！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1019
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_CanAnyoneHopeToBeatTrainer"
msgid ""
"Can anyone hope to beat this\n"
"TRAINER?\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"有谁能够打败\n"
"这位训练家吗？\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1024
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_DoBattlesExistSolelyForTrainer"
msgid ""
"Do battles exist solely for\n"
"this TRAINER?\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"对战难道就是\n"
"为这位训练家而存在的吗？\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1029
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_CurrentChampAimingToRetainTitle"
msgid ""
"The current champion aiming to\n"
"retain the title!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"现任冠军\n"
"志在卫冕！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1034
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_FormerChampHasReturned"
msgid ""
"The former champion has returned!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"前任冠军回来了！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1038
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_FormerToughnessReturned"
msgid ""
"The former toughness has returned!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"昔日的强大回来了！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1042
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_WillDoExpectedAdvanceToFinals"
msgid ""
"Will this TRAINER do as expected\n"
"and advance to the finals?\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"这位训练家能不负众望，\n"
"晋级决赛吗？\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1047
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_WillFormerChampRegainGlory"
msgid ""
"Will the former champ regain\n"
"lost glory?\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"前任冠军能否\n"
"夺回失去的荣耀呢？\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1052
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_FeelGlowOfTrueMaster"
msgid "Feel the glow of a true master!$"
msgstr "感受真正高手的光芒吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1055
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_MakeWayForDomeAceTucker"
msgid ""
"And now… The TRAINER standing in\n"
"{PLAYER}'s record-setting path…\p"
"Yes! The one and only!\n"
"The BATTLE DOME COMMISSIONER!\l"
"Our very own DOME ACE!\l"
"Make way for TUCKER!$"
msgstr ""
"接下来……挡在{PLAYER}\n"
"刷新纪录之路上的训练家是……\p"
"没错！独一无二的那个人！\n"
"对战巨蛋的负责人！\l"
"我们的巨蛋王牌！\l"
"塔克登场！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1063
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_SpectatorTuckerChant"
msgid ""
"Spectators: TUCKER! TUCKER!\n"
"TUCKER! TUCKER! TUCKER!$"
msgstr ""
"观众：塔克！塔克！\n"
"塔克！塔克！塔克！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1067
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_TuckerSilverIntro"
msgid ""
"TUCKER: Ahahah!\p"
"Do you hear it? This crowd!\n"
"They're all itching to see our match!\p"
"Ahahah!\p"
"I bet you're twitching all over from\n"
"the tension of getting to battle me!\p"
"But don't you worry about a thing!\p"
"I'm the no. 1 star of the BATTLE DOME!\n"
"I, TUCKER the DOME ACE, will bathe you\l"
"in my brilliant glow!$"
msgstr ""
"塔克：啊哈哈哈！\p"
"你听到了吗？这些观众！\n"
"他们都迫不及待想看我们的比赛！\p"
"啊哈哈哈！\p"
"能和我对战，你一定\n"
"紧张得浑身发抖吧！\p"
"不过你什么都不用担心！\p"
"我是对战巨蛋的头号巨星！\n"
"我，巨蛋王牌塔克，\l"
"会让你沐浴在我耀眼的光芒中！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1079
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_LetsSeeYourStrategy"
msgid ""
"Your strategy!\n"
"Let's see it!$"
msgstr ""
"你的战术！\n"
"让我看看吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1083
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_IncredibleVictorIsPlayer"
msgid ""
"Unbelievable! It's incredible!\n"
"The victor is {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""
"难以置信！太惊人了！\n"
"胜利者是{PLAYER}！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1087
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_WinnerIsTucker"
msgid ""
"The winner is TUCKER!\n"
"The DOME ACE has prevailed!\p"
"Congratulations, TUCKER!$"
msgstr ""
"获胜的是塔克！\n"
"巨蛋王牌获胜了！\p"
"恭喜你，塔克！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1092
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_SeeYourFrontierPass"
msgid ""
"TUCKER: Rules are rules!\n"
"Let me see your FRONTIER PASS.$"
msgstr ""
"塔克：规则就是规则！\n"
"让我看看你的开拓通行证。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1096
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_ReceivedTacticsSymbol"
msgid ""
"The Tactics Symbol was embossed on\n"
"the FRONTIER PASS!$"
msgstr ""
"开拓通行证上\n"
"印上了战术标志！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1100
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_WontUnderestimateYouNextTime"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\p"
"I sorely underestimated you. I won't\n"
"make the same mistake next time…$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"我太小看你了。\n"
"下次我不会再犯同样的错误了……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1105
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_CanWinStreakBeStretched"
msgid ""
"Can the win streak be stretched?\n"
"The confidence is there!$"
msgstr ""
"连胜纪录能继续延长吗？\n"
"信心满满！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1109
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_LegendHasReturnedDomeAceTucker"
msgid ""
"Ladies and gentlemen!\n"
"Boys, girls, and POKéMON!\p"
"Finally!\n"
"Finally, the legend has returned!\p"
"Yes, the name of that legend!\n"
"Our very own DOME ACE!\l"
"It's none other than TUCKER!$"
msgstr ""
"女士们，先生们！\n"
"男孩女孩们，还有宝可梦们！\p"
"终于！\n"
"传奇终于回来了！\p"
"没错，那位传奇的名字是！\n"
"我们的巨蛋王牌！\l"
"不是别人，正是塔克！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1118
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_TuckerGoldIntro"
msgid ""
"TUCKER: Ah…\n"
"The pummeling roar of the crowd…\l"
"Their furnace-like heat of excitement…\l"
"This is a wonderful place…\p"
"To the crowd, I am the DOME ACE…\n"
"I represent their hopes and dreams…\l"
"I must never fade from their sight…\p"
"I must burn!\n"
"Brighter and more brilliant!\l"
"I must light all that gather here!$"
msgstr ""
"塔克：啊……\n"
"观众震耳欲聋的欢呼声……\l"
"他们如熔炉般火热的激情……\l"
"这里真是个美妙的地方……\p"
"对观众来说，我是巨蛋王牌……\n"
"我代表着他们的希望和梦想……\l"
"我绝不能从他们的视线中消失……\p"
"我必须燃烧！\n"
"更加耀眼，更加辉煌！\l"
"我必须照亮聚集在这里的所有人！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1130
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_UnleashAllPowerIPossess"
msgid ""
"I will unleash all the power that\n"
"I possess! Right here and now!$"
msgstr ""
"我要在此时此地\n"
"释放我所有的力量！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1134
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_NeverLostWhenPowerUnleashed"
msgid ""
"TUCKER: You're genuinely fantastic!\p"
"Never before! I haven't ever lost in the\n"
"times I've had to unleash my power.\p"
"Yes, quite fantastic!\n"
"Your FRONTIER PASS, please?$"
msgstr ""
"塔克：你真的太了不起了！\p"
"从来没有过！我释放力量的时候\n"
"从来没有输过。\p"
"没错，真是了不起！\n"
"能给我你的开拓通行证吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1141
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_TacticsSymbolTookGoldenShine"
msgid ""
"The Tactics Symbol took on\n"
"a golden shine!$"
msgstr ""
"战术标志\n"
"发出了金色的光芒！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1145
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_LookForwardToNextEncounter"
msgid ""
"You're strong, but above all,\n"
"you have a unique charm!\p"
"In you, I see a definite potential for\n"
"a superstar like me.\p"
"I will very much look forward to\n"
"our next encounter!$"
msgstr ""
"你很强，但最重要的是，\n"
"你有一种独特的魅力！\p"
"在你身上，我看到了成为\n"
"像我一样的巨星的潜力。\p"
"我非常期待\n"
"我们的下一次相遇！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1154
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_PlayerIsLv50Champ2"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} is the Level 50\n"
"Battle Tournament Champion!\p"
"Congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}成为了\n"
"Lv.50对战锦标赛的冠军！\p"
"恭喜！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1160
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_PlayerIsLvOpenChamp2"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} is the Open Level\n"
"Battle Tournament Champion!\p"
"Congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}成为了\n"
"自由等级对战锦标赛的冠军！\p"
"恭喜！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1165
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_PlayerVersusTucker"
msgid ""
"The final match!\p"
"{PLAYER} versus the DOME ACE, TUCKER!\p"
"Let the battle begin!$"
msgstr ""
"决赛！\p"
"{PLAYER}对战巨蛋王牌塔克！\p"
"对战开始！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1170
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_RefereesDecidedWinnerTucker"
msgid ""
"The REFEREES have reached\n"
"a decision!\p"
"The winner is…\n"
"Oh, my goodness!\l"
"The winner is our very own DOME ACE!\l"
"It's TUCKER!\p"
"Congratulations! And thank you!\n"
"Let's hear it for the DOME ACE, TUCKER!$"
msgstr ""
"裁判已经作出判定了！\p"
"获胜的是……\n"
"哦，天哪！\l"
"获胜的是我们的巨蛋王牌！\l"
"是塔克！\p"
"恭喜！还有谢谢！\n"
"让我们为巨蛋王牌塔克喝彩吧！$"
